The low tone is indicated with the [[grave accent]] and the high tone with the [[acute accent]] on the vowel {{anglebracket|à è ɛ̀ ì ò ɔ̀ ù á é ɛ́ í ó ɔ́ ú}} or the syllabic n {{anglebracket|ǹ ń}}.
The [[nasalization]] is indicated with the help of the [[tilde]] under the vowel {{anglebracket|a̰ ɛ̰ ḭ ɔ̰ ṵ}} which can be combined with the acute or grave accent indicating the tone {{anglebracket|á̰ ɛ̰́ ḭ́ ɔ̰́ ṵ́ à̰ ɛ̰̀ ḭ̀ ɔ̰̀ ṵ̀}}.

